# Contributing to {{project_name}}

Maintained by **{{author}}** (`@{{github_user}}`).

## Development Guidelines

1. Keep pure domain models and validation free of filesystem, network, clock, and environment side effects.
2. Pair every bug fix or new feature with automated tests covering both normal paths and boundary failures.
3. Run the full verification suite (formatter, linter, type checker/compiler, and tests) before opening a pull request.
4. Keep pull requests focused, small, and linked to an ADR when introducing new architectural boundaries.
5. Never commit `.env` files, credentials, tokens, or local data artifacts.
